Nested Cluster Bonus

A new function nested_cluster_bonus(cluster_str) loops through sub-substrings. Each valid 3-value substring adds +1 to the bonus.

Then we add that to the total score. Labeled as debug_info["nested_cluster_bonus"].

Dynamic Hot Zone + Consensus Synergy

In extract_column_patterns, after computing the hot-zone points and checking if consensus_val is non-null, we call dynamic_hot_consensus_bonus(hot_b, consensus_val). If both are present, +4 synergy.

Explicit Logging

We attach each sub-bonus to a "debug_info" dictionary. The final score is the sum of all sub‐bonuses. The HTML display includes a “Debug Info” column that shows each sub‐bonus (mirror_bonus, nested_cluster_bonus, etc.) neatly.

